          "text": "# 二、键合空间、键和通口的定义;",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 76,
          "chunk_start": 59,
          "chunk_end": 76,
          "sentence_document_start": 59,
          "sentence_document_end": 76,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_92a196b84a791d92acd5",
          "document_start": 77,
          "document_end": 109,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 77,
          "end": 109,
          "chunk_start": 77,
          "chunk_end": 109,
          "sentence_document_start": 77,
          "sentence_document_end": 109,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b6ac92989f0047c709e1",
          "document_start": 111,
          "document_end": 130,
          "text": "在键合空间中，势和流的点乘确定了功率。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 111,
          "end": 130,
          "chunk_start": 111,
          "chunk_end": 130,
          "sentence_document_start": 111,
          "sentence_document_end": 130,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5dfb88d6d9aa4959c904",
          "document_start": 130,
          "document_end": 218,
          "text": "从系统的角度看，一个系统包含了若干个键合空间，功率总是由一个键合空间流向另一个键合空间，从而表现出能量在系统中的流动过程，因此在键合空间的表述时也把这种功率的流动关系表示出来。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 130,
          "end": 218,
          "chunk_start": 130,
          "chunk_end": 218,
          "sentence_document_start": 130,
          "sentence_document_end": 218,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6afaa9f17bffd59996fc",
          "document_start": 218,
          "document_end": 290,
          "text": "互为因果关系的势和流的点乘为功率，从系统来看，这种因果关系的确立对系统模型的建立和分析至关重要，所以在键合空间的表述时，也应体现出这种因果关系。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 218,
          "end": 290,
          "chunk_start": 218,
          "chunk_end": 290,
          "sentence_document_start": 218,
          "sentence_document_end": 290,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_10815f6bb6abbae7d139",
          "document_start": 290,
          "document_end": 390,
          "text": "特别要指出的是：键合空间和通常的三维真实空间是不一样的，键合空间要求其中流矢量和势矢量所有元素的因果关系具有一致性，而在三维真实空间中运动的物体，其各个运动坐标及其所受的力则没有这种严格的一致性要求；",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 290,
          "end": 390,
          "chunk_start": 290,
          "chunk_end": 390,
          "sentence_document_start": 290,
          "sentence_document_end": 390,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_35cb58915ac4a9c2c3f2",
          "document_start": 390,
          "document_end": 641,
          "text": "同时还要注意，在考虑键合空间中各矢量对时间的变化关系时，要把表示矢量的坐标值和键合空间的基同时考虑，所以尽管在后面许多地方我们所应用的键合空间的维数是一维，但这时的四种广义变量也不能单纯地看成标量，而是一个包含一维基和一个坐标值的乘积的量，对现实空间中运动的物体来讲，这个基往往是某个惯性空间的线性组合，如果这个基相对于惯性空间不变或变化可以不计，则四种广义变量的考虑和一般键合图理论中的标量考虑法是相同的，但如果基相对于惯性空间有变化且这种变化对系统来讲不能忽略，这时就必须同时考虑坐标值和基的变化。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 390,
          "end": 641,
          "chunk_start": 390,
          "chunk_end": 641,
          "sentence_document_start": 390,
          "sentence_document_end": 641,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a771b2e543c16042f330",
          "document_start": 641,
          "document_end": 666,
          "text": "这也是键合空间和一般标量系统键合图理论的最大差别。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 641,
          "end": 666,
          "chunk_start": 641,
          "chunk_end": 666,
          "sentence_document_start": 641,
          "sentence_document_end": 666,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_c251c47deff0081bf0fa",
          "document_start": 666,
          "document_end": 685,
          "text": "据以上这些因素定义键合空间的键的符号为",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 666,
          "end": 685,
          "chunk_start": 666,
          "chunk_end": 685,
          "sentence_document_start": 666,
          "sentence_document_end": 685,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_05c91334ed776750819e",
          "document_start": 687,
          "document_end": 707,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 687,
          "end": 707,
          "chunk_start": 687,
          "chunk_end": 707,
          "sentence_document_start": 687,
          "sentence_document_end": 707,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b61c447a1b527b756802",
          "document_start": 708,
          "document_end": 725,
          "text": "# 二、键合空间、键和通口的定义;",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 708,
          "end": 725,
          "chunk_start": 708,
          "chunk_end": 725,
          "sentence_document_start": 708,
          "sentence_document_end": 725,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_c83f10866f3379b2eb0f",
          "document_start": 726,
          "document_end": 758,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 726,
          "end": 758,
          "chunk_start": 726,
          "chunk_end": 758,
          "sentence_document_start": 726,
          "sentence_document_end": 758,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_77adb9bddfba856fd240",
          "document_start": 760,
          "document_end": 858,
          "text": "用图形符号“|→，→”表示，其中：箭体的线段代表键合空间，箭头表示功率的流向，用与箭体垂直的短线表示因果关系，当短线和箭头异侧时，表示功率流动的主因为流，当短线和箭头同侧时表示功率流动的主因为势。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 760,
          "end": 858,
          "chunk_start": 760,
          "chunk_end": 858,
          "sentence_document_start": 760,
          "sentence_document_end": 858,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9d43aa308d3d744789b6",
          "document_start": 860,
          "document_end": 880,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 860,
          "end": 880,
          "chunk_start": 860,
          "chunk_end": 880,
          "sentence_document_start": 860,
          "sentence_document_end": 880,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_fee0f12c16d919a1990f",
          "document_start": 881,
          "document_end": 898,
          "text": "# 二、键合空间、键和通口的定义;",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 881,
          "end": 898,
          "chunk_start": 881,
          "chunk_end": 898,
          "sentence_document_start": 881,
          "sentence_document_end": 898,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_23120d93e272f3e04ea5",
          "document_start": 899,
          "document_end": 931,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 899,
          "end": 931,
          "chunk_start": 899,
          "chunk_end": 931,
          "sentence_document_start": 899,
          "sentence_document_end": 931,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_1c3c12b2b0d721e3fed5",
          "document_start": 933,
          "document_end": 993,
          "text": "定义：在系统中系统与外部，系统内各子系统之间、各元件之间能够相互连接使功率流动的地方就叫通口，每一通口可用一根键来表示。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 933,
          "end": 993,
          "chunk_start": 933,
          "chunk_end": 993,
          "sentence_document_start": 933,
          "sentence_document_end": 993,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_e9fee800a144afa5583c",
          "document_start": 995,
          "document_end": 1015,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 995,
          "end": 1015,
          "chunk_start": 995,
          "chunk_end": 1015,
          "sentence_document_start": 995,
          "sentence_document_end": 1015,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6dee143f69be4ec828b0",
          "document_start": 1016,
          "document_end": 1025,
          "text": "# 一、阻性元件;",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 1016,
          "end": 1025,
          "chunk_start": 1016,
          "chunk_end": 1025,
          "sentence_document_start": 1016,
          "sentence_document_end": 1025,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_148d95787550eb174037",
          "document_start": 1026,
          "document_end": 1058,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 1026,
          "end": 1058,
          "chunk_start": 1026,
          "chunk_end": 1058,
          "sentence_document_start": 1026,
          "sentence_document_end": 1058,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f6d4eedb2a4a3324db74",
          "document_start": 1060,
          "document_end": 1121,
          "text": "与电路中的电阻和机械振动里的阻尼类似，我们把在一个通口处借助于某种已知的函数将该通口处的势和流联系起来的元件统称阻性元件。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 1060,
          "end": 1121,
          "chunk_start": 1060,
          "chunk_end": 1121,
          "sentence_document_start": 1060,
          "sentence_document_end": 1121,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_9406ccd08c01e1b18fb5",
          "document_start": 1121,
          "document_end": 1143,
          "text": "通常要求这种表示阻性元件特性的函数是可逆的。",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 1121,
          "end": 1143,
          "chunk_start": 1121,
          "chunk_end": 1143,
          "sentence_document_start": 1121,
          "sentence_document_end": 1143,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_3b4f31493e913c7edca1",
          "document_start": 1143,
          "document_end": 1147,
          "text": "定义式为",
          "section_id": "section_60779089a65e",
          "start": 1143,
          "end": 1147,
          "chunk_start": 1143,
          "chunk_end": 1147,
          "sentence_document_start": 1143,
          "sentence_document_end": 1147,
          "sentence_complete": true
        }
